# Resume and cover-letter format

Packets under `Resumes & Cover Letters/` use the corporate layout. Do not revive Palatino, all-caps names, or Education-before-Experience.

**Render:** markdown → `_render.py` (titles list) → HTML with `resume-corporate.css` / `cover-letter-corporate.css` → one-page PDF. Keep `md/`, `html/`, and `pdf/` in sync.

**Section order (required):** header → summary → **Experience** → **Education** → **Skills**. Education sits immediately above Skills, never above Experience.

**Resume markdown**

```
# Zakiy T. Manigo
**Target Title**

New York, NY  |  +1 (908) 230-6948  |  zakiymanigo@gmail.com  |  [linkedin.com/in/zakiymanigo](https://www.linkedin.com/in/zakiymanigo)

One-line summary, third person, no “I”.

## Experience
**Employer** | City, ST
Title | Mon YYYY – Present
- Action + context + result.

## Education
**Columbia University** | New York, NY
Bachelor of Science, Computer Engineering | May 2025
Combined Plan with St. Lawrence University. Bachelor of Arts, Mathematics, May 2023. Exchange: James Cook University, Townsville, QLD, 2022.

## Skills
**Label:** items
```

Dates right of ` | `. Spell out degrees. BariAccess: **Jun 2025 – Present**. One page. No photos, tables, colors, or two-column layout. Honesty gaps go in the letter, not on the resume. Do not invent GPA.

**Cover letters:** same header. Reusable: date, then `Dear Hiring Team:`. Named employer: date, inside address, `Re:` line, `Dear Recruiting Team:`.

**Examples folder:** `Resumes & Cover Letters/Examples/` is third-party formatting reference only — not Zakiy’s biography. Copy layout, never their content.

Own packets: `06-Rillet-Consultant` (named letter) and `01-Forward-Deployed-Engineer` (reusable).
